    # Phase 38.4 Krok 14g Etapa F Krok 5.I-H (16.5.2026 vecer): comp_def
    # entity pro form's save target (Marti's two-layer data_source pattern).
    # Form root id=37 (form_root, type=302) ma data_source_id=21
